{"type":"message","id":"d7217b85","parentId":"3aa6c336","timestamp":"2026-03-14T07:42:04.670Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 15:42 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为 Executor Subagent，执行自适应公告抓取测试：\n\n1. 使用 Playwright 访问以下3个URL，观察页面结构：\n   - http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/ (厦门市人力资源和社会保障局)\n   - http://sti.xm.gov.cn/ (厦门科学技术局)\n   - http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/ (福建省科技厅)\n\n2. 对于每个网站：\n   - 截图保存\n   - 提取页面标题和可见的链接列表\n   - 观察实际的 DOM 结构（不用预设选择器）\n   - 记录你看到的实际 HTML 结构\n\n3. 输出格式：\n   - 每个网站的结果\n   - 发现了什么选择器/结构\n   - 下次可以尝试的提取策略\n\n把结果保存到 ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/.learnings/test-2026-03-14.md"}],"timestamp":1773474124669}}
{"type":"message","id":"b6260690","parentId":"d7217b85","timestamp":"2026-03-14T07:42:17.771Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"作为 Executor Subagent，我需要执行自适应公告抓取测试。任务包括：\n1. 使用 Playwright 访问3个URL\n2. 对每个网站：截图、提取标题和链接、观察DOM结构\n3. 保存结果到指定文件\n\n我需要：\n1. 先检查目标目录是否存在\n2. 创建一个 Playwright 脚本来访问这些URL并收集信息\n3. 保存截图和结果\n\n让我开始执行这个任务。首先确保目标目录存在，然后创建脚本来抓取这些网站。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行自适应公告抓取测试。首先检查目标目录并创建抓取脚本。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f4c73c2ba013401a844a47eb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/.learnings"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773474124670}}
